Package: BETS
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian ETS Models with Adaptive Importance Sampling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Lorenzo", "Zambon",
      email = "lorenzo.zambon@supsi.ch",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian additive-error ETS state space models using adaptive
    importance sampling and supports model combination via Bayesian model
    averaging or stacking, with forecast generation via predict() and the
    forecast package interface.
